							},
							"string" : "Java spec: {{gtMethod:GtSmaCCJavaImporter>>ensureConstructorFrom:}} creates a `FAMIXMethod` named after the class, with `isConstructor: true`, `parentType` the class, `FAMIXParameter`s, modifiers, a signature like `Example(String)` and no declared type. It only runs for a `JavaConstructorDeclarationNode`, so an implicit default constructor *seems* not to be modelled (slice 0 pins this down)."
						},
