							},
							"string" : "Kotlin AST: there's no primary constructor node. {{gtClass:KotlinClassDeclarationNode}} holds `leftParen`, `parameters` ({{gtClass:KotlinClassParameterNode}}: `name`, `type`, `valToken`/`varToken`), `rightParen` and `constructorToken`. Secondary constructors are {{gtClass:KotlinSecondaryConstructorNode}} (`parameters`, `block`, `constructorCall`)."
